abstract: >-
  Julia algorithms and compact replication evidence accompanying Fast parametric
  solution of structured Markov decision processes: Multi-gear bandits. Includes
  optimized blocked fast-pivoting implementations, input generators and checksums,
  measured timing and simulation observations, and manuscript reporting scripts.
